  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh RRNRP - Contribution to IOM for multi-sectoral support to Rohingya refugees.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide multi-sectoral support to maintain humanitarian assistance and improve safety for Rohingya refugees in Bangladesh which is an ODA eligible country. Bangladesh is one of the least developed countries under the Current DAC list of ODA recipients.</narrative>
  </description>
